            <ArticleTitle>Arm pain as an unusual presentation of postdural puncture intracranial hypotension.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>910-2, table of contents</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="IMPLICATIONS" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">We report a case of a patient experiencing severe arm pain after dural puncture. This complication has not been reported previously. The patient was successfully treated with an epidural patch.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
